                  "format": "uri",
                  "default": null,
                  "x-order": 0,
                  "nullable": true,
                  "description": "A zip file containing the images that will be used for training. We recommend a minimum of 10 images. If you include captions, include them as one .txt file per image, e.g. my-photo.jpg should have a caption file named my-photo.txt. If you don't include captions, we will generate them for you."
                },
